# Anchored to the repo root ON PURPOSE. An unanchored `dist/` also matches
# web/dist/ — which is the embedded dashboard, not build output — and quietly
# kept it out of every commit. A fresh clone then failed to build at all
# (`pattern all:dist: no matching files found`), because go:embed needs it.
/dist/
/bin/
/ccquota

*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
.playwright-mcp/
